                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/14.2.0"&gt;14.2.0: Popup Android Screen Reader Accessibility&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui v14.2.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/IeuanWalker/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/IeuanWalker"&gt;@IeuanWalker&lt;/a&gt;, Android Screen Reader now properly reads Popup v2! Previously the screen reader would default to the underlying &lt;code&gt;PopupPage&lt;/code&gt;, now it defaults directly to the content of your Popup:&lt;/p&gt;
